          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>If We’re Going To Build This Category, <br/>We’re Going To Build It Right.</strong></p><p>At FUTR, we're not only nutrition industry veterans, but we’re also <strong>parents and coaches.</strong> We’ve stood on the sidelines, packed the bags, read the labels, and asked the same question every parent asks: <em>is this actually made for my kid?</em></p><p>That question became the reason we built FUTR, and the reason we believe this new category of youth sports nutrition has to be built differently from the start.</p><p><strong>Trust isn’t something we expect. <br/>It’s something we have to earn.</strong> </p>",
