            "text": "<p>Because what we're fueling is bigger than the next game.</p><p>A kid's future isn't ours to define. It isn't decided by a scoreboard, a ranking, a roster spot, or what anyone else thinks they should become.</p><p><strong>It's theirs.</strong></p><p>Sports may be part of the journey, but the lessons go far beyond it — showing up, putting in the work, being a teammate, handling setbacks, and continuing to believe in what's possible.</p><p>Their goals.<br/>Their dreams.<br/>Their FUTR.</p><p><strong>We're here to help fuel it.</strong></p>",
